.TH CBCBAYESGRACEDBINFO "1" "January 2026" "LALInference" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
cbcBayesGraceDBinfo \- Upload to the pe section of the graceDB page gid information about a lalinference postprocessing run.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cbcBayesGraceDBinfo.py
\fI\,--gid graceDBid --samples posterior_samples.dat\/\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
Upload to the pe section of the graceDB page gid information about a lalinference postprocessing run.
For the moment this is maximum a posteriori and stdev for the parameters in the string pars.
